WEBVTT

01:37.960 --> 01:38.840
I'm coming!

02:13.360 --> 02:17.840
COLOR FORMULA

03:09.400 --> 03:10.480
Yingying!

03:10.560 --> 03:12.360
Yingying, what happened to you?

03:12.440 --> 03:14.360
Are you not feeling well?

03:15.560 --> 03:16.400
Have a seat.

03:16.480 --> 03:19.200
Do you want me to help you
inside to get some rest?

03:19.280 --> 03:21.000
There's no need to rush for the work.

03:22.040 --> 03:23.000
No need.

03:23.520 --> 03:26.320
I finally figured out
the setting method for the new color.

03:26.400 --> 03:27.680
I must get it done as soon as possible.

03:28.280 --> 03:29.280
New color?

03:31.720 --> 03:34.320
I thought you can't stand
to look at red dye? Why did you use red?

03:35.280 --> 03:37.480
I can't avoid using red dye forever.

03:40.000 --> 03:40.880
I'm fine.

04:01.000 --> 04:03.160
Stop pushing yourself, okay?

04:03.240 --> 04:04.880
I might not know the reason,

04:04.960 --> 04:07.200
but I believe you must have your reason
to do that.

04:08.040 --> 04:09.920
Stop torturing yourself, okay?

04:22.680 --> 04:24.920
I promised Mr. Chen and the others

04:25.640 --> 04:27.840
that we'll participate
in the Splendor Showcase.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.160
We'll make a name for ourselves.

04:30.880 --> 04:32.680
I also promised my brother

04:33.440 --> 04:35.480
I'll pay off the Hua family's debts.

04:36.400 --> 04:38.280
I won't let them win.

04:40.680 --> 04:44.480
There's not enough time.
There's not enough time now!

04:45.720 --> 04:46.640
How about this?

04:47.160 --> 04:49.120
Tell me what to do. I'll help you.

04:51.760 --> 04:52.800
Don't worry.

04:52.880 --> 04:54.520
Have a seat.

05:03.040 --> 05:04.200
What should I add into it?

05:08.840 --> 05:10.320
One liang of locust tree flowers.

05:15.480 --> 05:17.200
Three liang of safflower.

05:23.760 --> 05:26.160
Crush them together.

05:33.560 --> 05:35.160
The Splendor Showcase is held once a year

05:35.240 --> 05:37.360
to find the best of the best
within the silk industry.

05:37.440 --> 05:39.640
Other than regular purchases,
all the brocade merchants

05:39.720 --> 05:42.280
will also come here to select silk
for the Brocade Weaving Competition.

05:42.360 --> 05:44.920
It is a grand festival
that connects all businesses.

05:45.000 --> 05:47.720
It has always been hosted
by the Brocade Bureau.

05:47.800 --> 05:50.360
Before it begins,
silk merchants have to pay a fee

05:50.440 --> 05:52.360
to get the license to enter.

05:52.440 --> 05:53.960
Those who are here
as a silk merchant for the first time

05:54.040 --> 05:56.040
will need to have a referee
on top of that.

05:57.240 --> 05:59.800
While a lottery system
is used to assign their stall's location,

05:59.880 --> 06:01.360
there are still some people

06:01.440 --> 06:04.120
who would privately purchase
and take over others' location.

06:04.200 --> 06:05.560
To ensure the fairness of the system,

06:05.640 --> 06:07.920
the Brocade Bureau
has to check multiple times.

06:08.440 --> 06:10.600
You don't have a care
about your voice, do you?

06:10.680 --> 06:12.120
It's cracking from all your talking.

06:12.640 --> 06:14.520
To be precise, you're the one
who doesn't care about me.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.080
You don't want to listen to me talk.

06:16.760 --> 06:18.320
What did we agree on before coming here?

06:18.400 --> 06:19.480
- Those who use their fists…
- Are yours.

06:19.560 --> 06:21.120
- Those who use their pens…
- Are mine.

06:21.200 --> 06:22.120
It's good you remember that.

06:22.640 --> 06:25.000
I think there are a lot of people
in this venue.

06:25.080 --> 06:26.880
If anything happens,
it could get out of hand.

06:26.960 --> 06:28.720
We need to post a notice

06:28.800 --> 06:30.760
to remind everyone
to do business honestly,

06:30.840 --> 06:32.600
treat others with kindness,
respect the venue,

06:32.680 --> 06:33.960
and not cause problems.

06:34.040 --> 06:36.400
No need to be too lengthy. Five thousand
to 10,000 words are enough.

06:36.480 --> 06:37.320
Yes.

06:40.440 --> 06:42.120
Peace at last. Brat…

06:42.200 --> 06:43.320
Mr. Yang!

06:47.840 --> 06:49.480
Mr. Yang's attentive preparation

06:49.560 --> 06:52.200
is what allowed the Splendor Showcase
to be so successful!

06:52.280 --> 06:54.480
Thanks for your hard work. Thank you!

06:54.560 --> 06:56.200
You must be exhausted.

06:56.280 --> 06:58.680
Can I treat you to a drink?

06:58.760 --> 07:00.640
The first rule of the event!

07:00.720 --> 07:03.960
Focus on your business,
and don't talk to me.

07:04.480 --> 07:05.760
When was there ever such a rule?

07:05.840 --> 07:06.800
We're writing it down!
It'll be put up soon!

07:06.880 --> 07:10.280
Jinglan has always been thoughtful
and meticulous.

07:11.200 --> 07:14.080
The second rule of the event!
Refer to me as Mr. Yang.

07:20.960 --> 07:22.040
You're looking for me?

07:22.720 --> 07:23.560
What's up?

07:24.360 --> 07:25.520
What are you carrying?

07:25.600 --> 07:27.960
It's the silk we prepared
for the Splendor Showcase previously.

07:28.720 --> 07:30.840
There's no use for them anymore!
We can't even get in.

07:30.920 --> 07:34.280
Yingying said even though we can't
get into the Splendor Showcase's venue,

07:34.360 --> 07:36.440
we can still set up a stall outside.

07:37.720 --> 07:41.320
As long as people get to see it,
it's not a waste of our efforts.

07:42.120 --> 07:43.440
Ji Yingying said that?

07:43.960 --> 07:47.880
Hey! Did you forget how she fooled us?
Why do you still trust her?

07:48.560 --> 07:50.280
Do you know why I came to you?

07:50.800 --> 07:52.880
It's because I think
you are different from the others.

07:56.160 --> 07:58.680
You might seem like
a reckless scoundrel on the outside,

07:59.560 --> 08:00.960
but you're a kind person on the inside.

08:01.560 --> 08:02.720
You are honorable.

08:04.400 --> 08:05.760
I guess I judged you wrongly.

08:05.840 --> 08:07.440
Talk properly. Don't go.

08:09.840 --> 08:12.120
It's just the Splendor Showcase! I'll go!

08:15.680 --> 08:17.800
But I don't want to set up a stall
by the roadside.

08:17.880 --> 08:19.520
If we're going, we'll go inside.

08:19.600 --> 08:21.680
But we don't have a license.

08:22.880 --> 08:25.080
My face is all the license we need!

08:42.039 --> 08:44.200
When it comes to silk
within the whole of Shu,

08:44.280 --> 08:45.880
if I say I'm the second best,

08:45.960 --> 08:47.600
then nobody would dare
call themself the best!

08:52.560 --> 08:56.520
This number one booth
is the best spot within the venue.

08:56.600 --> 08:59.600
Anyone who comes to make purchases
will pass through here.

08:59.680 --> 09:01.600
The Liu family got the spot.

09:01.680 --> 09:03.680
But there was news
from the Liu family this morning

09:03.760 --> 09:05.520
that they have fallen sick.

09:05.600 --> 09:06.480
They can't leave their home.

09:08.440 --> 09:10.760
The ones who got the best spot
didn't come?

09:10.840 --> 09:12.120
Interesting.

09:12.760 --> 09:13.720
You're done?

09:14.960 --> 09:15.800
Yes.

09:15.880 --> 09:17.880
I should have made you write 20,000 words!

09:19.040 --> 09:21.080
You must be tired, Mr. Yang.

09:21.880 --> 09:25.600
I prepared some snacks for you to enjoy.

09:31.520 --> 09:34.080
The Liu family's booth
will be left empty anyway,

09:34.160 --> 09:35.680
- Mr. Yang,
- Mr. Yang!

09:35.760 --> 09:37.160
Why not give it to me?

09:38.320 --> 09:39.160
Mr. Yang,

09:41.000 --> 09:43.400
I have a jade Kylin.

09:45.040 --> 09:48.720
I just… wonder if I can appreciate it

09:49.440 --> 09:51.080
with you privately?

09:51.680 --> 09:52.960
You want the Liu family's booth?

09:53.040 --> 09:54.800
You also want the Liu family's booth?

09:54.880 --> 09:55.720
Yes, yes.

09:55.800 --> 09:59.840
Zhuge, take them to somewhere… quiet.

09:59.920 --> 10:02.240
Take a close look
and compare them carefully.

10:02.760 --> 10:04.160
- Okay.
- Go on.

10:04.240 --> 10:05.120
Go on.

10:09.200 --> 10:13.320
My dear,
do you think Master's method will work?

10:13.400 --> 10:15.080
Can it really determine
Yang Jinglan's true intentions?

10:15.920 --> 10:21.120
If he accepts the gifts,
he'll just be another greedy moron.

10:21.640 --> 10:22.640
We don't have to fear him.

10:23.760 --> 10:25.560
If he doesn't accept it,

10:25.640 --> 10:29.120
that proves he's after something
more important than wealth.

10:29.640 --> 10:31.800
Then, we must be even more careful of him.

10:33.960 --> 10:35.240
You're right, my dear.

10:38.160 --> 10:41.400
San Hua Pavilion's aged wine
is just what I wanted!

10:44.000 --> 10:47.560
He accepts bribes in public.
Yang Jinglan must have lost his mind.

10:48.560 --> 10:51.320
The greedier he is,
the better it is for us.

10:52.440 --> 10:54.000
Not bad.

10:56.320 --> 10:57.800
This is an exquisite jade peony!

10:57.880 --> 10:59.800
It should be worth
at least a fortune, right?

11:00.680 --> 11:02.840
Mrs. Hua, you're too kind.

11:04.320 --> 11:06.000
I'm glad you like it.

11:07.240 --> 11:09.240
Place this peony in my study.

11:10.120 --> 11:11.000
Yes.

11:14.600 --> 11:15.600
Mr. Yang,

11:15.680 --> 11:18.840
you're going to place the peony
in your study.

11:18.920 --> 11:20.320
Then the empty…

11:21.760 --> 11:22.800
Booth?

11:23.720 --> 11:27.160
Zhuge, send some men to prepare
light refreshments and place some mats

11:27.240 --> 11:29.520
for the people passing by
to get some rest.

11:30.320 --> 11:31.520
Mr. Yang!

11:31.600 --> 11:33.960
You've accepted our gifts.
Why aren't you keeping up your end?

11:36.960 --> 11:40.000
Aren't these the gifts

11:40.080 --> 11:42.440
you prepared for the winners
of the Splendor Showcase?

11:42.520 --> 11:43.520
Gifts?

11:46.360 --> 11:50.280
Why… did you bring up the booth?

11:51.400 --> 11:54.840
Are you trying to bribe me in public?

11:57.280 --> 11:59.880
Zhuge, what's the punishment for bribery?

11:59.960 --> 12:03.000
Light whipping if it's not serious.
The death penalty if it is.

12:03.080 --> 12:06.080
Death penalty? Hmm?

12:13.600 --> 12:15.800
My dear, w-what should we do now?

12:16.320 --> 12:19.960
He has completely played us for fools.

12:30.920 --> 12:32.040
Can that work?

12:32.120 --> 12:34.480
Why don't we listen to Yingying
and sell outside?

12:34.560 --> 12:37.000
Don't listen to her. Listen to me.
I have the final say!

12:37.520 --> 12:38.680
Sang Shisi.

12:40.120 --> 12:41.720
Are you tryingto pull a fast one on me?

12:42.720 --> 12:43.880
What did I do?

12:43.960 --> 12:45.480
Firstly, I did not take
any of your booths.

12:45.560 --> 12:47.760
Secondly, I am not selling silk.

12:48.600 --> 12:50.120
This is my outfit.

12:50.200 --> 12:52.800
I want to wear this
and take a spin around here.

12:52.880 --> 12:55.960
- Can't I? Can't I?
- Sure. Here.

12:58.400 --> 12:59.760
You like to spin?

13:00.520 --> 13:04.360
You can spin inside this circle
until the event ends.

13:04.440 --> 13:07.000
I'll send someone here
to bring you some food and drinks.

13:07.080 --> 13:08.600
Don't say I'm not nice to you.

13:08.680 --> 13:11.760
However, if you dare
take a step out of the circle…

13:14.240 --> 13:15.720
- Beat him!
- Yes!

13:15.800 --> 13:17.360
Mr. Yang, you…

13:19.280 --> 13:21.680
A-Are you still my best friend?

13:21.760 --> 13:22.720
Best friend?

13:23.720 --> 13:26.080
I… Mr. Yang,
are you going to do this to me?

13:26.680 --> 13:29.040
You really plan to lock them there
until the event is over?

13:29.120 --> 13:32.720
If I don't do that,
who knows what trouble they will attract?

13:32.800 --> 13:34.200
Without their mastermind around,

13:34.280 --> 13:36.600
they're setting themselves up to fail
sooner or later.

13:36.680 --> 13:38.560
Their mastermind hasn't showed up.

13:38.640 --> 13:40.120
I heard she locked herself up at home.

13:40.840 --> 13:43.240
Do you think Ji Yingying gave up?

13:43.960 --> 13:45.160
She won't.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.960
She won't? How do you know that?

13:47.480 --> 13:51.640
She's not Ji Yingying
if she knows the meaning of giving up.

13:52.960 --> 13:55.280
Look! What is that?

13:55.880 --> 13:57.120
So pretty!

14:14.880 --> 14:15.800
Look!

14:26.200 --> 14:30.560
Flowers are falling from the sky,
yet the wind is coming from the southwest.

14:39.600 --> 14:41.440
Yingying, I think someone is here.

14:42.360 --> 14:43.880
I am indeed waiting for someone.

14:43.960 --> 14:47.240
If not, it would be a waste
of my silk's elegant appearance.

14:50.320 --> 14:51.440
Catch!

14:56.040 --> 14:56.960
So, it was you, Ms. Ji.

14:59.520 --> 15:00.960
Are you here to enjoy the view too,
Mr. Yang?

15:05.040 --> 15:06.120
Ji Yingying,

15:07.360 --> 15:08.720
what are you doing?

15:11.640 --> 15:13.560
Since I cannot participate
in the Splendor Showcase,

15:13.640 --> 15:15.520
there is no longer any use for this silk.

15:15.600 --> 15:18.080
So, out of boredom,
I turned it into pom-poms

15:18.160 --> 15:19.080
and tossed them around for fun.

15:20.440 --> 15:22.520
Mr. Yang, this is not illegal, is it?

15:24.080 --> 15:27.000
Who said that the silk is useless
if you cannot enter the Splendor Showcase?

15:27.080 --> 15:30.480
Miss, I would like some silk
dyed in this color.

15:30.560 --> 15:33.560
We can place an order right now.

15:33.640 --> 15:36.080
This silk is a new color, correct?

15:36.160 --> 15:37.880
I have never seen it before.

15:38.880 --> 15:41.440
That is correct. This is a new color
produced by my family, the Ji family.

15:41.520 --> 15:44.440
The lovely girls are drunk on wine,
their faces flushed.

15:44.520 --> 15:46.280
Hence, this color is named Flushed Rose.

15:47.120 --> 15:49.440
Since it is a new color,
it has to be registered.

15:50.040 --> 15:52.080
If you sell it without registration,

15:52.160 --> 15:54.960
Ms. Ji, you will be sent to prison.

15:55.760 --> 15:58.480
When have I ever said
I would sell it right now?

15:59.920 --> 16:02.960
The formula must be stable
if you wish to register a new color.

16:03.720 --> 16:04.920
The color must be long-lasting.

16:05.000 --> 16:07.040
Your new color has not been tested yet.

16:07.120 --> 16:11.320
Do you suppose
it was a random color produced by chance,

16:11.400 --> 16:13.080
never to be made again?

16:13.760 --> 16:16.480
Everyone,
do you not deem it too hasty a decision

16:16.560 --> 16:18.560
to place an order right now?

16:21.400 --> 16:23.720
Since they have their doubts,

16:24.240 --> 16:27.240
Ms. Ji, would you like to accept an order
from my family, the Yang family, first?

16:28.440 --> 16:30.520
I would like
five dans of Flushed Rose silk.

16:30.600 --> 16:32.640
I will be expecting them
one month after registration.

16:33.440 --> 16:36.360
We can discuss the price later.
Here is the deposit.

16:37.920 --> 16:40.040
Mrs. Yang, you paid the deposit
without signing an order.

16:40.120 --> 16:41.640
Are you not worried
that I might cheat you?

16:43.480 --> 16:46.280
Our family can afford
to lose this bit of wealth.

16:46.880 --> 16:48.880
Ms. Ji, with talent like yours,

16:48.960 --> 16:52.440
surely such things are below you.

16:52.960 --> 16:54.320
This is merely a formality.

16:57.560 --> 17:02.040
Mr. Yang, surely you would not object
to such a small request?

17:02.120 --> 17:05.599
You both willingly agreed to it,
so that is none of my business.

17:06.319 --> 17:09.359
Thank you for your patronage, Mrs. Yang.
I will not disappoint you.

17:10.440 --> 17:13.000
She advertised her silk,
even though she was not selling it.

17:13.520 --> 17:15.800
She accepted an order
for a new color without registering it.

17:15.880 --> 17:17.200
Mr. Yang,

17:18.520 --> 17:19.440
is this not against the rules?

17:21.079 --> 17:24.400
Yes, it has indeed violated
the rules I have established.

17:26.800 --> 17:28.000
Ms. Ji,

17:28.800 --> 17:32.120
you have scattered pom-poms
all over the place,

17:32.200 --> 17:34.880
hence disrupting
the cleanliness of the venue.

17:34.960 --> 17:37.120
You should clean the place up.

17:38.040 --> 17:39.200
Rest assured, Mr. Yang.

17:39.280 --> 17:43.360
I will definitely rid the venue
of all trash.

18:10.720 --> 18:12.040
Good work, Ms. Ji.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.200
Why are you still here?

18:15.280 --> 18:17.320
Ms. Ji, you are not done
with cleaning yet,

18:17.400 --> 18:19.200
so, of course,
I have to stay and keep an eye on you.

18:20.960 --> 18:22.640
Keep watching then, Mr. Yang,

18:22.720 --> 18:25.560
lest you accuse me
of not cleaning properly.

18:31.120 --> 18:33.400
The falling flowers were a pleasant
surprise to everyone present.

18:33.480 --> 18:35.760
Even if I punished you, Ms. Ji,

18:35.840 --> 18:38.560
I cannot prevent the masses
from desiring the new silk.

18:39.080 --> 18:41.280
Your efforts were not in vain, Ms. Ji.

18:42.040 --> 18:43.160
However…

18:46.040 --> 18:47.040
However what?

18:49.880 --> 18:52.520
Flushed Rose has stunned the whole crowd.

18:53.040 --> 18:56.000
It may be exchanged for gold,
but it cannot win hearts.

18:59.960 --> 19:02.400
Mr. Yang, what do you mean by that?

19:02.480 --> 19:03.880
If you do not understand it, forget it.

19:06.880 --> 19:10.320
Ms. Ji, can you please
take a look at this silk

19:10.400 --> 19:12.080
and see if there is
anything special about it?

19:13.680 --> 19:15.520
Mr. Yang, is this a request?

19:18.080 --> 19:20.120
It can be leverage
in a transaction as well.

19:20.200 --> 19:22.200
Transactions must be fair.

19:22.280 --> 19:24.600
If I help you, what do I get in return?

19:25.920 --> 19:29.160
I will clean the place with you.
How does that sound?

19:44.440 --> 19:45.560
I have asked someone
to appraise this silk before.

19:46.160 --> 19:47.360
It is called the imperial yellow silk.

19:47.440 --> 19:48.840
It is probably an imitation.

19:48.920 --> 19:50.200
In terms of color,

19:50.280 --> 19:53.000
it is identical
to authentic imperial yellow silk.

19:53.600 --> 19:56.280
However,
it feels slightly different to the touch.

19:56.360 --> 19:57.680
They dare not confirm the suspicions,

19:57.760 --> 20:00.680
so I would like you to appraise it,
Ms. Ji.

20:01.360 --> 20:03.440
When dyeing genuine imperial yellow silk,

20:03.520 --> 20:06.560
wood ash lye must be used to form
a color sediment to set the dye.

20:07.480 --> 20:10.480
The color mixing process is complex,
and the dye is expensive.

20:10.560 --> 20:12.880
It is mainly used to make imperial satin
as a tribute to the emperor.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.360
As for the silk in my hand,

20:14.440 --> 20:16.920
it was only treated with sulfur
to brighten and set the color.

20:17.000 --> 20:19.160
The threads were made
with blended silk as well.

20:19.760 --> 20:23.080
The color is also not distributed evenly.
Indeed, its quality is subpar.

20:23.840 --> 20:25.800
If it was made for the emperor,

20:25.880 --> 20:29.400
then why would they use
blended silk with subpar quality?

20:30.000 --> 20:32.120
You should ask the person
who dyed the silk.

20:32.200 --> 20:34.120
I am not the right person you should ask.

20:35.640 --> 20:38.160
That is true. I should not have asked you.

20:43.680 --> 20:46.520
Mr. Yang, what did you mean
by the words you said just now?

20:47.360 --> 20:50.560
- Which words? I said a lot of words.
- Winning hearts.

20:52.120 --> 20:53.160
Oh, hearts.

20:54.240 --> 20:56.080
Human hearts
are like these fallen flowers.

20:57.080 --> 20:59.400
They have no fixed shape or form.

20:59.480 --> 21:02.240
They rise with the wind
and gather with the breeze.

21:02.760 --> 21:03.840
When the wind stops, the flowers fall.

21:04.440 --> 21:06.040
They come together
and scatter without a trace.

21:11.240 --> 21:14.320
Ms. Ji, if you wish to win hearts,

21:14.880 --> 21:15.960
you must first identify

21:16.480 --> 21:19.520
the wind that has gathered them
in the first place.

21:20.400 --> 21:21.480
Mr. Yang, if you are insulting me

21:21.560 --> 21:23.120
for caring about profit
instead of connections,

21:23.200 --> 21:24.480
you do not have to go to such lengths.

21:25.280 --> 21:26.120
Is that not the case?

21:27.040 --> 21:27.960
Have you ever lacked money?

21:28.560 --> 21:30.360
I value wealth,
but I obtain it via legal means.

21:30.440 --> 21:32.160
Have you ever been forced into a corner?

21:33.800 --> 21:36.800
Even in hopeless situations,
I will not succumb to crime.

21:37.400 --> 21:40.040
That is remarkable of you, Mr. Yang,
but such virtues are beyond me.

21:40.120 --> 21:42.480
I can only prioritize my gains
and use underhanded tactics.

21:51.280 --> 21:52.680
You have cleaned up enough.

21:53.440 --> 21:55.320
- You may go home.
- Goodbye.

22:09.560 --> 22:10.400
Yingying.

22:10.920 --> 22:12.840
Yaoting, why are you still here?

22:13.600 --> 22:15.040
It is getting colder these days.
Put this on.

22:18.200 --> 22:20.280
I was just done with work,
so I feel quite hot.

22:20.360 --> 22:22.280
I am even sweating. You put it on.

22:22.360 --> 22:24.600
That is exactly why you must be careful
not to catch a cold.

22:24.680 --> 22:25.520
I will be fine. Hurry.

22:30.400 --> 22:31.520
- Just put it on!
- Yingying!

22:31.600 --> 22:32.480
Yingying.

22:34.680 --> 22:38.160
Yingying, I made some warm soup for you.
Hurry and drink it.

22:39.720 --> 22:41.840
Mr. Ji, I did not know you were here too.

22:41.920 --> 22:43.480
If not, I would have made some
for you as well.

22:43.560 --> 22:47.520
That is alright.
I do not feel cold at all.

22:51.280 --> 22:54.680
Well, since you are here now,
I do not have to worry anymore.

22:54.760 --> 22:56.920
I shall head back
and cover up for you now.

22:57.000 --> 22:59.200
Do come home soon.

22:59.720 --> 23:01.080
Yaoting, we can go together.

23:01.160 --> 23:03.240
- No need.
- Have some soup then, Yaoting?

23:03.320 --> 23:04.200
No need!

23:08.920 --> 23:10.360
How did you know I was here?

23:10.880 --> 23:12.760
The flowers floated all around.

23:12.840 --> 23:15.160
After what happened today,

23:15.240 --> 23:17.000
everyone in Yizhou
already knows about you.

23:22.480 --> 23:24.120
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

23:24.200 --> 23:25.400
Time is up.

23:26.040 --> 23:28.520
Are you paying the debt,
or are you selling yourself?

23:28.600 --> 23:30.720
Make up your mind, Mrs. Ji.

23:32.440 --> 23:33.280
Mrs. Hua,

23:33.800 --> 23:34.920
you should be aware that

23:35.000 --> 23:38.360
shopkeepers are ordering
the new Flushed Rose silk these days.

23:38.440 --> 23:40.160
Do you not want a part of it?

23:41.520 --> 23:45.800
I can give you some Flushed Rose silk
free of charge.

23:45.880 --> 23:46.720
You can rewrite the order

23:46.800 --> 23:49.440
so that my family's debt is paid
with Flushed Rose silk.

23:49.520 --> 23:50.360
What do you think?

23:53.040 --> 23:56.320
The worth of this silk
may change without warning.

23:56.400 --> 23:58.560
Who knows how long your Flushed Rose
can remain in the spotlight?

23:58.640 --> 24:01.680
I would feel more secure
if you pay me real money.

24:03.080 --> 24:04.720
I can lower the price by a third.

24:06.400 --> 24:08.840
You will be gaining a risk-free profit.

24:08.920 --> 24:12.000
I am asking for money, not silk.

24:14.160 --> 24:16.760
If you cannot pay up within today,

24:16.840 --> 24:19.520
you will have to follow me to the bureau.

24:26.880 --> 24:28.160
If that is the case,

24:28.720 --> 24:32.200
Yaoting, please gather the shopkeepers
who wish to buy the Flushed Rose silk.

24:32.280 --> 24:33.320
We will accept their orders.

24:40.600 --> 24:41.720
CONTRACTING PARTY: HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

24:51.160 --> 24:52.200
Eight hundred wen.

24:57.040 --> 24:58.960
BOND OF DEBT

25:15.000 --> 25:16.000
Eight hundred wen.

25:16.520 --> 25:17.360
CONTRACT

25:18.360 --> 25:19.200
CONTRACTING PARTY: HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

25:26.000 --> 25:27.120
Seven hundred wen.

25:38.360 --> 25:39.280
Two guan.

25:53.960 --> 25:57.440
Mother, this is the last one. You do it.

26:22.720 --> 26:25.080
Today, the Ji family has paid
its debts in full.

26:25.680 --> 26:28.320
Take the money and leave right now.

26:28.960 --> 26:32.560
If you wish to come again next time,
do send us a notice first.

26:35.320 --> 26:40.640
I wish you success
and a bright future, Ms. Ji.

26:40.720 --> 26:42.080
Same to you, Mrs. Hua.

26:44.160 --> 26:45.560
My dear, my dear!

26:50.000 --> 26:51.920
Take the money.
Do not leave even a single coin!

26:52.000 --> 26:52.840
Yes, sir.

27:17.800 --> 27:18.640
My dear,

27:18.720 --> 27:22.360
would we not profit more
if we get the Flushed Rose silk?

27:22.440 --> 27:24.120
Why did you insist on getting money
from the Ji family?

27:24.200 --> 27:25.640
You fool.

27:27.840 --> 27:30.120
I want the Ji family to fall to ruin.

27:30.200 --> 27:32.880
I want Ji Yingying to work for me.

27:32.960 --> 27:36.080
I want her to make Shu Red Silk for me.

27:37.160 --> 27:39.320
What use would I have
for the Flushed Rose silk orders?

27:40.800 --> 27:43.400
But the Ji family has cleared their debt.

27:43.480 --> 27:44.920
How do we deal with them now?

27:46.320 --> 27:48.960
New types of silk must be registered
before they can be sold.

27:50.080 --> 27:52.960
The Brocade Bureau
will verify the new silk

27:53.040 --> 27:54.720
and then get someone

27:54.800 --> 27:57.120
to send the registration document
to Chang'an for approval.

27:57.200 --> 27:59.960
This process takes at least two weeks.

28:00.480 --> 28:03.120
If any trouble crops up in between,

28:03.200 --> 28:05.640
seeing how many orders she has accepted,

28:05.720 --> 28:07.960
she will have a lot to explain
to the shopkeepers.

28:08.040 --> 28:11.680
But the Brocade Bureau
is impenetrable now.

28:11.760 --> 28:14.400
Yang Jinglan is obviously
on the Ji family's side.

28:14.480 --> 28:16.000
Can we really do it?

28:18.680 --> 28:20.560
Shall we ask Master for help?

28:20.640 --> 28:23.080
If Master has to do everything herself,

28:24.160 --> 28:25.520
she would not have needed us
in the first place.

28:27.920 --> 28:31.480
Pick the greediest person
out of those Master gave us.

28:31.560 --> 28:33.160
Tell them to keep an eye on the people

28:33.240 --> 28:34.480
in charge of verification
at the Brocade Bureau.

28:36.240 --> 28:37.120
You are so clever.

28:42.200 --> 28:46.840
ZHAO RESIDENCE

28:49.680 --> 28:50.720
Thank you, Mrs. Zhao.

28:52.960 --> 28:54.320
You're too kind, Mrs. Zhao.

28:58.720 --> 29:02.320
Mrs. Ji, Ms. Ji, a few days ago,

29:02.400 --> 29:07.040
my daughter-in-law acted on her own accord
and visited the Ji family

29:07.560 --> 29:09.280
without proper etiquette.

29:09.800 --> 29:11.000
I hope you can forgive her.

29:11.880 --> 29:15.120
Well, my daughter
has just dyed some new silk

29:15.200 --> 29:18.080
and wants to send it here for your review,
Mr. Zhao Senior.

29:25.520 --> 29:26.920
It is indeed a fine color.

29:27.520 --> 29:29.920
When will it be registered and cataloged?

29:30.000 --> 29:32.240
Barring any unexpected delays, in 20 days.

29:32.320 --> 29:36.040
The Zhao family is willing to pay double

29:36.120 --> 29:39.480
for the Ji family
to prioritize supplying silk to us.

29:42.080 --> 29:43.400
To be honest,

29:43.480 --> 29:45.880
Mr. Zhao Senior, you are not the first
to make such a request.

29:46.680 --> 29:48.000
In business, fairness is key.

29:48.080 --> 29:51.200
The order of supply must follow
the principle of first come, first served.

29:51.720 --> 29:56.000
If Huanhua Dyehouse wishes to last long,
I cannot break this rule.

29:57.240 --> 29:58.080
Of course…

29:58.160 --> 30:00.440
But the Ji family and Zhao family
share a bond.

30:00.520 --> 30:01.720
I cannot ignore that.

30:01.800 --> 30:04.720
This half basket of silk
is a token of my sincerity.

30:04.800 --> 30:06.960
It should suffice for you
to test your brocade pattern.

30:08.240 --> 30:09.960
Ms. Ji, you are most thoughtful.

30:12.800 --> 30:15.440
I hear the Yang family has already
given you an advance deposit.

30:21.320 --> 30:24.720
Indeed. At a time
when no one else offered help,

30:24.800 --> 30:27.480
Mrs. Yang recognized the opportunity
and supported us when we needed it most.

30:28.000 --> 30:30.800
It's only right
for Yingying to repay them.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.720
Of course…

30:33.320 --> 30:37.280
The Yang family has always been known
for their integrity in the brocade trade.

30:37.360 --> 30:40.640
Every brocade merchant
seeks talented people.

30:40.720 --> 30:42.800
If the Zhao family had been there,

30:43.320 --> 30:46.000
we never would have stood idly by.

30:46.520 --> 30:48.040
Naturally.

30:51.520 --> 30:52.800
It is getting late,

30:52.880 --> 30:55.040
and Yingying must return to dye the silk.

30:55.120 --> 30:56.920
We will take our leave.

30:58.400 --> 31:00.760
Summon Xiuyuan to escort them home.

31:01.920 --> 31:02.960
Yes, sir.

31:12.560 --> 31:15.920
At least we have regained
some dignity for our family.

31:17.800 --> 31:18.760
Yingying,

31:20.560 --> 31:22.280
I will say it again.

31:22.920 --> 31:25.560
Mr. Zhao is a good man.

31:25.640 --> 31:28.040
He has done much to support our family.

31:28.120 --> 31:31.120
I once hoped you might marry him.

31:31.200 --> 31:34.160
But after all that has happened,

31:34.240 --> 31:36.120
I have come to realize something.

31:36.640 --> 31:38.400
Breaking off the engagement
may not be a bad thing.

31:39.320 --> 31:42.120
If one day you were to marry
into the Zhao family,

31:42.200 --> 31:43.720
I dread to think of how much humiliation
you might endure.

31:43.800 --> 31:47.000
Mother, my response is still the same.

31:47.080 --> 31:50.080
The Zhao family
and Mr. Zhao are different.

31:50.160 --> 31:51.560
Silly child.

31:51.640 --> 31:55.440
Marriage is never just between two people.
It is always between two families.

31:56.720 --> 31:57.880
With the Zhao family as they are,

31:57.960 --> 32:00.560
I worry you would only face
more grievances in the future.

32:05.160 --> 32:06.000
Mrs. Ji.

32:06.600 --> 32:07.520
Yingying.

32:09.280 --> 32:10.240
Mother…

32:12.960 --> 32:14.080
I am going for a walk in the market.

32:44.960 --> 32:46.960
Why are you staring at me like that?

32:47.040 --> 32:49.440
If you are not saying anything,
I will just head home.

32:49.520 --> 32:52.640
I have designed the pattern
according to your handkerchief.

32:53.520 --> 32:54.360
Really?

32:56.640 --> 32:58.880
I knew you would succeed.

32:58.960 --> 33:01.880
With the pattern done,
even without my Flushed Rose,

33:01.960 --> 33:03.720
your grandfather will surely set you free.

33:04.800 --> 33:06.720
- It is not the same.
- How is it not the same?

33:07.320 --> 33:09.920
You came here just for me.
That makes it different.

33:11.760 --> 33:13.480
I was still a little slow.

33:13.560 --> 33:17.280
If I had been faster,
I might have seen your falling flowers.

33:19.320 --> 33:20.200
Do you want to see it?

33:21.920 --> 33:22.960
Close your eyes.

33:27.040 --> 33:28.280
And no peeking!

33:45.480 --> 33:48.960
This flower is for you alone.
Are you satisfied?

33:50.000 --> 33:51.240
It is unforgettable.

33:53.800 --> 33:56.000
Flushed Rose is just the beginning.

33:56.080 --> 33:57.960
Once I reconcile
with Mr. Chen and the others,

33:58.040 --> 34:00.520
I will focus on growing Silk Society.

34:00.600 --> 34:02.000
In a year or two,

34:02.080 --> 34:05.400
half of the Zhao family's silk
will have to come from us.

34:05.480 --> 34:08.159
Your family will be falling
over themselves to curry favor with me.

34:10.239 --> 34:11.639
Are you saying that

34:11.719 --> 34:13.199
if I do not become Brocade Master
by that time,

34:13.280 --> 34:14.639
I will not be worthy of you?

34:15.639 --> 34:18.239
- You better work hard.
- All right.

34:20.840 --> 34:24.560
But for now, the most pressing matter
is how to reconcile with Mr. Chen.

34:25.080 --> 34:27.920
I have taken several orders
for Flushed Rose,

34:28.000 --> 34:29.920
and I can barely keep up.
Help me out, won't you?

34:30.000 --> 34:31.560
Hurry up! Let's go!

34:31.639 --> 34:32.639
Why are you slow?

34:32.719 --> 34:35.440
Honestly, Ms. Ji shows so much sincerity.

34:35.520 --> 34:37.440
She visits you three times every day!

34:37.520 --> 34:39.400
Why not just accept her apology?

34:39.480 --> 34:40.719
Why insist on being so stubborn?

34:40.800 --> 34:43.760
You can do it yourself. I cannot do it.

34:45.719 --> 34:46.719
Mr. Jiang,

34:47.239 --> 34:49.480
- tell her I am not home.
- Mr. Jiang, are you home?

34:51.719 --> 34:54.520
He says he is not home. Please go back.

35:00.640 --> 35:02.080
But my mother said that

35:02.160 --> 35:04.160
no matter who is at fault,

35:04.240 --> 35:09.040
since everyone chose to work together,
she should not have kept this from us.

35:13.960 --> 35:15.520
YUEBUHUAN INN

35:15.600 --> 35:17.640
Yaoting and I have been
running around all day,

35:17.720 --> 35:19.800
and everyone ignored us.

35:20.560 --> 35:22.360
It was not entirely fruitless.

35:22.440 --> 35:25.080
At least now, my parents trust you.

35:25.160 --> 35:27.080
Even my father
does not want to control me anymore.

35:28.320 --> 35:31.160
The deal was made,
but the friendship was lost.

35:31.240 --> 35:32.600
It is not worth it.

35:37.880 --> 35:41.280
Yu, does your tavern
have to entertain just anyone?

35:41.360 --> 35:45.080
Can you keep those idle busybodies out
in the future?

35:45.920 --> 35:46.880
Pay me double the price for wine,

35:46.960 --> 35:49.200
and I guarantee
you will never see him again.

35:49.800 --> 35:50.880
Not worth it!

35:53.080 --> 35:54.160
Zhuge,

35:54.240 --> 35:57.960
I heard the registration process
requires my personal seal.

35:58.040 --> 36:00.080
What if I do not want to stamp it?

36:01.880 --> 36:02.800
Then, there is no other way.

36:14.560 --> 36:16.320
You are known for your fairness
and integrity, Mr. Yang.

36:16.400 --> 36:17.640
Surely you would not do such a thing.

36:18.400 --> 36:20.960
Am I not an idle busybody
who meddles unnecessarily?

36:22.640 --> 36:25.520
I misspoke. I will punish myself
by drinking the wine!

36:37.880 --> 36:38.720
That is enough.

36:42.920 --> 36:45.240
It was just a joke.
Why take it so seriously?

36:46.160 --> 36:49.160
In business, one must know
when to yield or stand firm.

36:49.680 --> 36:50.920
But does that apply to situations
other than that as well?

36:52.960 --> 36:54.880
To you, Mr. Yang, it was a joke.

36:55.400 --> 36:58.280
But to me, it is my livelihood.

37:16.600 --> 37:17.920
It was I who misspoke.

37:19.280 --> 37:20.360
I apologize.

37:33.560 --> 37:35.840
I am unhappy. No one can control me.

37:37.200 --> 37:38.720
Even in the middle of the night,

37:38.800 --> 37:40.520
he will wake up feeling regret
for his rudeness.

37:44.280 --> 37:46.240
Look at the silk from Mr. Jiang's place.

37:46.320 --> 37:47.760
Does it not look like hair?

37:49.280 --> 37:51.520
If any of you go bald in the future,
come to me.

37:51.600 --> 37:53.640
I am sure you can use it.

37:53.720 --> 37:55.560
Hurry up!

37:55.640 --> 37:57.320
What is all the arguing about?

37:59.080 --> 38:01.160
What a coincidence! We meet again!

38:01.240 --> 38:04.040
Take a look at my newly dyed silk,
Flushed Rose.

38:05.200 --> 38:06.680
The weather is far too hot.

38:06.760 --> 38:09.240
I will be in the woods for a while.
Are you going or not?

38:09.320 --> 38:11.000
Did you hear that? Mr. Sang is overheated.

38:11.080 --> 38:13.000
- Escort him to the woods!
- Understood!

38:18.760 --> 38:20.240
Petty men!

38:21.280 --> 38:24.080
Yingying, wait for me.
I will go talk to them myself.

38:28.640 --> 38:30.280
You are being unreasonable!

38:31.120 --> 38:32.120
Us? Unreasonable?

38:32.200 --> 38:34.160
Ji Yingying was even more unreasonable
at Lei Zu Festival.

38:34.880 --> 38:37.160
Yingying sincerely wants
to make peace with you.

38:37.240 --> 38:40.240
We have been neighbors for years,
washing silk side by side.

38:40.320 --> 38:41.600
Are you going to ignore her forever?

38:41.680 --> 38:43.800
When she wanted
to marry into the Zhao family,

38:43.880 --> 38:44.960
did she consider us her friends then?

38:45.040 --> 38:47.760
Yaoting already explained.
It was a misunderstanding.

38:47.840 --> 38:49.360
All a scheme by Mrs. Hua.

38:49.440 --> 38:52.840
My mother said,
without trust, one has no foundation.

38:52.920 --> 38:56.960
Even if it was a scheme,
she abandoned us for her brother.

38:57.680 --> 38:59.360
A business can recover.

38:59.440 --> 39:01.960
But if someone goes to prison,
their reputation is ruined forever.

39:02.040 --> 39:03.400
Can you not tell what is more important?

39:03.480 --> 39:06.280
You expect me to reconcile with her?
Never!

39:06.360 --> 39:08.360
How about the rest of you?
What do you say?

39:08.440 --> 39:10.200
Whatever you say is what we will say.

39:10.280 --> 39:12.240
We stand united. No soft-heartedness here.

39:12.320 --> 39:13.280
No soft-heartedness!

39:13.360 --> 39:15.800
Whoever sides with her today is this!

39:17.360 --> 39:19.840
Give me back my hairpin!
Or I will be impolite.

39:19.920 --> 39:21.040
Impolite?

39:21.120 --> 39:23.000
- Did you hear that, everyone?
- She said she will be impolite.

39:23.080 --> 39:25.440
- Oh, how frightening.
- Today, without those boys protecting you,

39:25.520 --> 39:28.360
I would love to see
exactly how you plan to be impolite.

39:28.440 --> 39:31.880
I promised my mother I would not fight.
Do not push me into breaking that promise.

39:32.400 --> 39:34.800
But we want to push you today.

39:34.880 --> 39:37.640
- We will push you. We will touch you.
- I dare you to touch me!

39:37.720 --> 39:39.840
- I'm touching you…
- I will beat you to death!

39:39.920 --> 39:40.920
Do not do it!

39:41.720 --> 39:42.880
Don't you dare touch me!

39:44.480 --> 39:47.560
Yingying, we are coming!

40:28.880 --> 40:30.760
You could not even get a hairpin back?

40:31.280 --> 40:33.160
You are hopeless. Here, take it.

40:36.760 --> 40:37.840
About Lei Zu Festival…

40:59.400 --> 41:02.520
I had no choice
about everything that happened.

41:02.600 --> 41:05.800
But regardless,
you all were hurt because of me.

41:05.880 --> 41:07.760
You are not at fault.

41:07.840 --> 41:10.640
It was me who wronged you.

41:13.760 --> 41:15.960
Will you still join me to do business?

41:37.360 --> 41:38.200
Mr. Jiang…

41:38.920 --> 41:41.080
- This is it.
- You are this.

41:41.160 --> 41:43.400
All of you are this.

41:45.560 --> 41:47.800
Can I take it as you agreeing to it?

41:47.880 --> 41:48.920
You are hopeless.

41:55.600 --> 41:56.960
Listen carefully.

41:57.040 --> 41:59.960
I have come up
with a new name for Silk Society.

42:00.040 --> 42:01.200
What is it?

42:01.280 --> 42:02.560
Bloom Society.

42:02.640 --> 42:04.560
Bloom Society?

42:05.320 --> 42:07.280
As long as we dare to dream,

42:07.360 --> 42:10.400
no worldly chains,
towering mountains, or raging seas

42:10.480 --> 42:11.720
can hold us back.

42:12.320 --> 42:14.760
Those major dyehouses
either have benefactor

42:14.840 --> 42:15.960
or collude with each other

42:16.040 --> 42:18.600
to monopolize the silk trade
and bully others.

42:18.680 --> 42:21.800
But if we stand united,
supporting each other,

42:21.880 --> 42:24.240
and ensure our silk
is of the finest quality,

42:24.320 --> 42:26.720
we will carve out our own path.

42:26.800 --> 42:28.440
We will never allow ourselves
to be bullied again.

42:29.920 --> 42:32.080
We will never judge by birthright,

42:32.160 --> 42:33.560
never cling to old ways,

42:33.640 --> 42:35.560
and never push out our own.

42:35.640 --> 42:37.960
We will work together
and make our name known in Yizhou!

42:44.040 --> 42:46.360
Are you willing to join Bloom Society?

42:46.440 --> 42:47.640
Hold on.

42:47.720 --> 42:49.120
Could you say a little less?

42:49.200 --> 42:50.480
What I care about most is,

42:50.560 --> 42:53.160
am I still
the honorary president in Bloom Society?

42:53.240 --> 42:54.080
Of course you are!

42:54.160 --> 42:56.040
Then that is settled. Bloom Society!

42:56.120 --> 42:57.120
Yes, Bloom Society!

42:57.200 --> 43:00.320
Bloom Society…

43:00.400 --> 43:01.240
Bloom Society!

43:01.320 --> 43:02.720
Bloom Society.
